WEBVTT

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:07.010
Yuta...

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:10.350
Yuta...

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:13.650
Yuta?

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:14.410
Wait!

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:17.200
What are you doing?

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:20.160
C'mon, we have a contract.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.410
Yuta, fulfill the contract.

00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:27.030
Even I realize that this has to be a dream.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.370
But the fact that I am having this dream...

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:31.440
means I may be harboring expectations.

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:33.420
In other words, well...

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:35.530
What?!

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:38.130
Ow!

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:40.640
I thought so.

00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:44.020
What is that you're doing?

00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:48.090
Wicked Lord Shingan is generating
a Zero-G magnetic field.

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:51.190
The gravity within this room
is now under my control.

00:00:54.810 --> 00:00:56.950
Y-Yuta, are you okay?

00:00:57.560 --> 00:00:59.260
Hey, what was that noise?

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:07.540
It's an emergency! Yuta!

00:01:08.030 --> 00:01:11.250
Why you little...

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:12.710
Emergency...

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:15.980
Knock that off!

00:01:13.830 --> 00:01:16.970
Yuta, that hurts!

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:53.650
My current mobility is too limited
to evade attack.

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:55.510
Magical Devil Girl in Pursuit

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:55.850
Life function critical.

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:58.100
Your roller shoes are banned
for the foreseeable future!

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:01.030
That is what you get for
putting a hole in my ceiling!

00:03:01.100 --> 00:03:05.030
That can't be right! I obtained
a permit from the Committee!

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:06.910
What committee?

00:03:07.150 --> 00:03:10.160
Gasp! Did they have a hand in this?!

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:13.570
If so, I must hurry before
the situation becomes dire.

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:18.280
Either her chunibyo is getting worse,
or she's having a relapse.

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:22.760
We may fulfill our contract as we see fit!

00:03:23.170 --> 00:03:26.510
Maybe if I hadn't said all that to her,
by now we'd be...

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:28.020
Yuta?

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:31.300
No, no, no, no! Not, not, not, not!

00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:32.660
Rikka and I aren't like that!

00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:34.520
I said what I said because
I thought it was the right solution.

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:37.810
Mobility confirmed!

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:38.690
Well, don't!

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:41.240
What is it now?

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:43.610
Wicked One gale force heroic blast!

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:47.440
It's working!

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:49.270
No, not at all.

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:51.120
So what? Am I the enemy now?

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:52.250
No.

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:56.530
I will summon the Dark Flame Dragon within you.

00:03:56.530 --> 00:03:57.500
Dark Flame Dragon?

00:03:57.760 --> 00:03:58.450
Yes.

00:03:58.580 --> 00:03:59.670
The Dark Flame Dragon

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:02.880
is a mutation of the Black Flame Dragon having gained dark powers.

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:06.010
It is the source of the
Dark Flame Master's powers...

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:08.460
...and it is your dragon soulmate.

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:13.390
And why do you need it right this moment?

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:17.680
The Enemy approaches.
I believe her to be a powerful magic user.

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:20.280
A magic user? Do you mean Toka?

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:23.880
No. I have already imprisoned
the Priestess within the Vatican...

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:26.060
...with the might of my dark powers.

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:27.240
Don't make her mad.

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:29.760
The magic user is even more powerful.

00:04:30.360 --> 00:04:32.900
I fear this person is one of the demon elite...

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:36.000
...and so I must summon the Dark Flame Dragon.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:37.750
That's my T-shirt!

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:40.370
The magical injection is completed.

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:41.910
I order you, on the name of
Wicked Lord Shingan...

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:45.290
...Dark Flame Dragon sleeping
within this man! Appear before me!

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:48.880
Stop that! Don't draw
summoning circles on my stuff.

00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:51.710
Which actually looks pretty damned good.

00:04:51.710 --> 00:04:53.340
Yuta, suit up!

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:54.130
I refuse!

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:56.060
Or at least I'd like to refuse...

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:57.650
...but I appreciate the effort this took.

00:04:57.800 --> 00:04:58.650
Really?

00:04:58.890 --> 00:05:01.760
But I can't just put it on either.

00:05:03.060 --> 00:05:07.390
All right, I will put it on if you get
better marks than me on the next test.

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:10.120
If you get worse marks, the Dark Flame Dragon
will be confined. Deal?

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:12.030
Cheh!

00:05:12.030 --> 00:05:13.850
Don't give me that 'cheh'!

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:17.110
Oh, no. I let my guard down.

00:05:21.030 --> 00:05:23.290
Foolish Dark Flame Master!

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:25.160
I will show you the might of
Wicked Lord Shingan...

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:26.930
...in a way you will not soon forget!

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:28.180
YUTA TOGASHI

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:29.350
RIKKA TAKANASHI

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:30.790
They're nearly identical!

00:05:30.790 --> 00:05:34.420
Be quiet! Now you are servant to a servant!

00:05:34.420 --> 00:05:37.230
Master, you are awesome! My fervor is renewed!

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:39.230
Rikka, you really worked hard.

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:40.470
Naturally!

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:42.180
Now, Dark Flame Master!

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:46.610
You must now produce the Dark Flame Dragon
that resides within you for my master!

00:05:49.110 --> 00:05:50.370
Who are you supposed to be?

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:53.490
Therefore, you will wear this.

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:55.610
And what is this?

00:05:55.610 --> 00:05:57.750
As you can see, it is a magical girl costume.

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:59.700
I thought I had to wear a T-shirt!

00:05:59.700 --> 00:06:01.410
You're awfully picky for a man.

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:03.780
How did a magical girl costume
enter the equation?!

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:06.380
The Dark Flame Dragon
responds powerfully to magic.

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:09.470
Therefore, the act of wrapping
your entire body in magic...

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:11.760
...will prompt it to appear.

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:14.670
I designed it to flatter you.

00:06:14.670 --> 00:06:16.840
Dekomori and I co-produced it.

00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:18.270
It is a true tour de force!

00:06:18.470 --> 00:06:20.520
Don't worry. Through the all-seeing
Wicked Lord Shingan...

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:23.550
...I have measured your waist, hips and bust.

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:25.530
Are you aware that I'm a guy?

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:28.890
Due to the unfortunate fact that
there are no male magical girls...

00:06:28.890 --> 00:06:31.270
...its production was fraught with difficulty.

00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:32.860
So, I have prepared this.

00:06:32.860 --> 00:06:33.740
Twin tails?!

00:06:34.020 --> 00:06:37.620
Incidentally, your transformation call
is personalized just for you: "Brave Up!"

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:38.330
Enough!

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:40.670
Now, transform at once!

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:41.420
Yuta!

00:06:43.530 --> 00:06:44.930
Kumin-senpai?

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:48.910
Understood! A deal is a deal!

00:06:48.910 --> 00:06:51.870
Why are you removing your clothing?!
You must transform!

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:52.680
Like how?!

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:57.560
How did this happen? Let's see here.

00:06:58.050 --> 00:07:00.010
Hey, it isn't bad at all...

00:07:00.010 --> 00:07:02.300
...yeah, right.

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:06.430
Everyone, come wish with me!

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:07.940
Magical...

00:07:15.020 --> 00:07:17.400
Whew, a flawless parabola.

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:19.030
I'll say!

00:07:19.030 --> 00:07:21.500
How could you do that to my phone?!

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:25.240
Holy moley! Nibutani putting the moves
on Togashi in drag!

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:26.250
Erase it!

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:28.390
Move it.

00:07:31.870 --> 00:07:34.300
Ooh, have you finished your transformation?

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:37.090
It looks really good on you. I am relieved.

00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:38.180
I am not.

00:07:38.490 --> 00:07:40.380
Yuta, speak the incantation!

00:07:40.380 --> 00:07:41.380
I will not!

00:07:41.380 --> 00:07:43.270
You look so cute, Togashi!

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:46.630
Wait, have you joined them, Kumin?!

00:07:46.630 --> 00:07:49.970
Deko just happened to have this prototype.

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:51.730
Would you like to try it on?

00:07:51.730 --> 00:07:53.280
No, thanks, I'm good.

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:57.910
Far-East Magical Napping
Society Summer Thereof

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:57.580
Hey, you! The angel! I'm here to make war!

00:07:57.580 --> 00:07:58.430
Come on out, you...

00:08:00.260 --> 00:08:02.190
It appears I am summoned.

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:03.950
How can you tell from that announcement?

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:06.240
I know, for I am an angel.

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:07.920
A deep black fallen angel to be precise.

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:11.750
Does that mean I have been
servant to a fallen angel?

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:13.930
That is a good development! Very smart!

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:17.180
I take my leave. Please exercise caution, Yuta.

00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:20.300
We'll show you what kind of angels we can be!

00:08:20.590 --> 00:08:22.840
Wicked Lord Shingan detection mode activated!

00:08:22.840 --> 00:08:24.550
Location: the vicinity of the intercom room!

00:08:25.820 --> 00:08:27.680
What's angelic about that?

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:29.900
And who was that on the intercom?

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:38.280
INTERCOM ROOM

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:32.310
I will look in this direction!

00:08:32.310 --> 00:08:33.350
It's all yours.

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:34.740
Spatial breakaway!

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:38.280
She must be in the area.

00:08:44.030 --> 00:08:44.960
It is you!

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:47.360
I knew you were the angel.

00:08:47.660 --> 00:08:50.670
Now, are you a surviving angel,
or are you a new kind of angel?

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:52.530
Either way, you have perfect timing!

00:08:57.460 --> 00:09:00.460
I am Sophia Ring SP Saturn VII!

00:09:00.460 --> 00:09:04.920
I am the magical devil girl Sophia
the whole town is talking about.

00:09:05.340 --> 00:09:09.180
I am otherwise known as "she who rules
the devilish magical seven holy lands!"

00:09:09.180 --> 00:09:11.230
You'd do well to remember that!

00:09:11.560 --> 00:09:14.860
I am the Wicked Lord Shingan,
the deep black fallen angel...

00:09:15.350 --> 00:09:16.690
...Rikka Takanashi!

00:09:17.310 --> 00:09:21.320
So, you are the Wicked Lord Shingan?
I could not ask for a better opponent.

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:24.000
Very well, let us commence the war!

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:26.930
Fine. Wicked Lord Shingan, activate!

00:09:27.280 --> 00:09:30.130
Field, deploy!
Imprisoned King Containment Ring!

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:33.010
Devil Lord, recognized.
Magical power, released.

00:09:33.320 --> 00:09:34.380
Be destroyed, real.

00:09:34.660 --> 00:09:36.010
Cherubim aria.

00:09:36.210 --> 00:09:37.510
Blow up, synapses!

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:39.010
Seraphim, descend!

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:41.100
Banishment This World!

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:43.310
Cyndrilical metaphysical!

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:56.600
That was an impressive display of ability.

00:09:56.850 --> 00:09:59.410
You are definitely the angel I took you to be.

00:09:59.690 --> 00:10:02.950
I sense an unpleasant premonition
from you. So you must die.

00:10:03.230 --> 00:10:05.150
Split open, Door of Darkness!

00:10:05.150 --> 00:10:07.110
Release the darkness within.

00:10:07.110 --> 00:10:10.040
Utilize the power of the King of Demise
to scatter the fictitious ...

00:10:08.030 --> 00:10:10.040
The ultimate magic so soon?!

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:11.670
...and conduct me to the finale!

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:14.030
Schwarz Aschenputtel!

00:10:15.020 --> 00:10:16.720
Vulcanus Shield!

00:10:19.230 --> 00:10:22.080
The shield was improvised,
but that was real power!

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:24.850
Very clever, fallen angel Wicked Lord Shingan.

00:10:25.300 --> 00:10:28.230
Sophia just may have to take off
the kid gloves with you.

00:10:28.760 --> 00:10:29.890
Don't waste your time.

00:10:38.140 --> 00:10:41.770
I'm so sorry, but I am a magical devil girl...

00:10:41.770 --> 00:10:44.730
...quite unlike your typical
powder-puff magical girl.

00:10:45.230 --> 00:10:48.410
How many of my Thousand Phoenix
do you think you can dodge?

00:10:48.820 --> 00:10:49.920
Maximum shield!

00:10:50.230 --> 00:10:52.170
Firebird Flame Flash!

00:10:58.040 --> 00:11:00.080
Overconfidence is your own worst enemy!

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:02.850
A marionette?!

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:05.100
Infinity system, activate!

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:09.760
Crimson Vermillion Flame.

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:12.770
Entwine the darkness and become dark flame.

00:11:10.590 --> 00:11:11.770
Aria magic?!

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:15.230
Be entombed in the abyss!

00:11:15.220 --> 00:11:16.730
Onyx Flame Cannon!

00:11:16.970 --> 00:11:18.520
Suppressive defense!

00:11:21.140 --> 00:11:22.040
Shichimiya.

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:24.120
Hey, Shichimiya!

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:29.830
It's Hero.

00:11:31.150 --> 00:11:32.000
What?!

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:41.930
STAFF ROOM

00:11:40.430 --> 00:11:41.930
You know better than that.

00:11:42.290 --> 00:11:45.130
You can't enter a school
you don't attend without permission.

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:47.560
I'm sorry.

00:11:47.880 --> 00:11:49.090
Allow me to explain!

00:11:49.090 --> 00:11:53.010
Satone Shichimiya is a girl I hung out with
in Year One of middle school.

00:11:53.010 --> 00:11:57.300
As a matter of fact, she is the Patient Zero
who caused my chunibyo outbreak.

00:11:57.810 --> 00:12:01.560
I heard the way she spoke,
saw her in invisible combat...

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:04.320
...decided it was awesome, and imitated her.

00:12:04.810 --> 00:12:07.110
Incidentally, both the Dark Flame Master...

00:12:07.110 --> 00:12:09.390
...and "Be enveloped in the flames
of darkness and disappear!"

00:12:09.390 --> 00:12:11.360
...both sort of came from her.

00:12:12.030 --> 00:12:15.460
Wow, this is great. Is this your hideout, Hero?

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:18.210
Yuta, that one is dangerous. Stand back.

00:12:18.530 --> 00:12:21.300
Do you want to resume our battle,
Deep Black Fallen Angel?

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:26.430
Apparently Shichimiya, in her chunibyo way,
decided that Rikka is a fallen angel,

00:12:23.410 --> 00:12:26.430
I'll make you regret ever picking a fight with Sophia!

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:29.460
then deduced from her uniform which school
she attends, and came to see her.

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:30.180
I'll show you the power of a magical devil girl!

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:32.810
I never knew she had taken a turn for the worse.

00:12:32.880 --> 00:12:34.720
Do not push your luck!

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:36.050
I will take you out next time.

00:12:36.050 --> 00:12:36.810
Don't.

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:39.310
Sorry, but I have to go home early.

00:12:39.310 --> 00:12:40.010
What?!

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:43.390
Nana told me to walk Shichimiya home.

00:12:44.390 --> 00:12:45.880
Very well, we will celebrate our

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:48.080
reunion by raising a glass to the posthumous world!

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:48.900
Too close!

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:50.790
Yes, yes, but only with juice.

00:12:51.150 --> 00:12:54.360
Later! You really haven't
changed a bit, have you?

00:12:58.570 --> 00:13:01.920
I'm surprised trackers from the
Organization were still around.

00:13:02.290 --> 00:13:04.080
You should exercise caution.

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:05.500
Here.

00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:09.210
Now, let us drink!

00:13:09.800 --> 00:13:13.170
I have to be straight with you.
I'm through with all that.

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:14.170
Through?

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:15.100
Yes.

00:13:15.410 --> 00:13:18.360
Do you mean you're moving up from
Level 7 to a Level 8 hero?

00:13:18.510 --> 00:13:21.100
No! It's over, finished, done!

00:13:21.100 --> 00:13:23.430
No more fires of darkness
and no more Dark Flame Master!

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:25.820
I'm having a distinctive feeling of deja vu.

00:13:26.060 --> 00:13:29.000
Hero, did you look into the angel's eye?

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:32.020
No! I am not a hero anymore.

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:34.320
I am an average Year Two high school student!

00:13:34.320 --> 00:13:35.040
You, Hero?

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:39.290
Yeah. Actually, I haven't been called "hero"
in more than three years.

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:44.300
I see. That sounds boring.

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:46.050
Boring? How?

00:13:46.370 --> 00:13:48.750
It's boring because it's boring.

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:51.090
The world is such a big, interesting place!

00:13:51.090 --> 00:13:53.930
What's with you? We're going.

00:13:54.230 --> 00:13:55.740
So, how do you get home?

00:13:56.090 --> 00:13:57.650
Well, let's see...

00:13:58.380 --> 00:13:59.740
You take this train?

00:14:00.050 --> 00:14:00.650
Yeah.

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:02.300
And get off here?

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:02.930
Yeah.

00:14:03.630 --> 00:14:04.820
And cross this bridge?

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:05.320
Yeah!

00:14:05.680 --> 00:14:08.030
But this is...

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:10.730
You live right above me.

00:14:10.730 --> 00:14:14.570
Huh? So the Togashi nameplate is yours, Hero?

00:14:14.570 --> 00:14:15.540
Don't call me that.

00:14:15.860 --> 00:14:18.900
Are you living with Wicked Lord Shingan?!

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:20.160
How do you know that?!

00:14:21.400 --> 00:14:23.450
Crimson Vermillion Flame.

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:26.380
Entwine the darkness and become dark flame.

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:28.820
Be entombed in the abyss!

00:14:28.820 --> 00:14:30.640
Onyx Flame Cannon!

00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:33.500
Wicked Lord Shingan ultimate magic.

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:35.430
Purgatorial Fascination!

00:14:35.880 --> 00:14:38.090
Um, what should I do?

00:14:38.090 --> 00:14:39.970
Purgatorial fascination...

00:14:39.970 --> 00:14:42.390
...is one of Wicked Lord Shingan's
eight deep secrets.

00:14:42.390 --> 00:14:44.100
It is his most powerful attack.

00:14:44.100 --> 00:14:47.890
A provisional magical devil girl such as
yourself could not possibly resist it.

00:14:47.890 --> 00:14:49.810
O-oh, I get it. Okay...

00:14:52.650 --> 00:14:54.290
Ooh, Master! That is incredible!

00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:55.290
It is not!

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:58.400
Honestly. How is that a magical girl?

00:14:58.400 --> 00:15:00.030
That's just a commando girl.

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:01.290
Go away.

00:15:01.490 --> 00:15:05.650
In the first place, magic is used
to make people happy.

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:08.290
The spirits who manipulate magic...

00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:11.040
...were always thoroughly pure of heart.

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:13.800
They never resorted to brute force...

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:15.090
Wait, what?!

00:15:15.090 --> 00:15:15.640
Memo, memo.

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:17.800
Morisummer, you're very knowledgeable.

00:15:17.800 --> 00:15:19.310
This will help to know thy enemy.

00:15:19.720 --> 00:15:21.130
I need to write this down.

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:23.640
Hey, stop taking notes!

00:15:23.640 --> 00:15:26.340
What's with the magical girl stuff anyway?

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:29.360
That is the secret organization's hideout.

00:15:29.960 --> 00:15:31.810
A huge factory.

00:15:31.810 --> 00:15:33.870
It's suspicious. Very suspicious.

00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:35.230
Shichimiya?

00:15:35.230 --> 00:15:35.770
Yes.

00:15:35.770 --> 00:15:38.620
Shichimiya... Shichimiya who?

00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:42.150
Apparently she and Togashi used to be friends.

00:15:42.150 --> 00:15:44.950
She and Rikka suddenly
started fighting each other.

00:15:44.950 --> 00:15:46.000
An old friend?

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:47.950
Could she be his ex?

00:15:47.950 --> 00:15:49.540
It's nothing like that.

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:51.010
No, you never can tell.

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:53.790
She goes to another school
but stormed into our school...

00:15:53.790 --> 00:15:57.670
...and then went home with Togashi, right?
There's something to it.

00:15:57.670 --> 00:15:58.600
Like what?

00:15:58.670 --> 00:16:01.090
It's the scene of the crime! A love triangle!

00:16:01.090 --> 00:16:03.150
Morisummer, you're very bloodthirsty.

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:05.890
I'm not, really.

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:07.400
And stop calling me Morisummer!

00:16:07.710 --> 00:16:09.770
I don't really know anything...

00:16:09.770 --> 00:16:13.120
...but I really don't think it will come to that.

00:16:14.730 --> 00:16:18.440
I swear on Wicked Lord Shingan
that I will never give in to the devil!

00:16:18.440 --> 00:16:19.370
Yes!

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:22.330
Satone?

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:23.700
Who goes there?

00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:26.040
It's Kuzuha. Have you forgotten about her?

00:16:26.320 --> 00:16:28.420
What? Oh, it's you, Kuzuha!

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:29.910
Kuzuha!

00:16:30.200 --> 00:16:32.570
No way! How did you get so tall?

00:16:32.570 --> 00:16:36.520
It's been three years.
You haven't changed much at all.

00:16:36.520 --> 00:16:37.720
I'm shocked.

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:41.340
At this rate, you'll be the size
of a demonic non-articulated-foot worm!

00:16:41.340 --> 00:16:42.760
Non-articulated?

00:16:43.220 --> 00:16:45.770
Yuta! I have returned to base!

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:46.960
I urgently require supplies...

00:16:49.640 --> 00:16:52.360
I did not anticipate she would infiltrate this easily!

00:16:54.020 --> 00:16:57.520
Did you actually believe I would be
stopped by such a weak barrier?

00:16:57.520 --> 00:17:00.290
Do not underestimate
the power of Sophia's magic.

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:01.640
Settle down.

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:04.190
Hey, no fair! Why only me?

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:06.780
Rikka, go put your bag away.

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:09.860
Shichimiya's folks are going to be
late home from work...

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:12.420
...so she'll be eating supper with us.

00:17:12.730 --> 00:17:13.420
All right?

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:18.830
If you don't like it, we can settle here and now
who is the superior magical girl.

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:19.970
Just knock it off.

00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:21.840
Ow. That's very effective, Hero.

00:17:21.840 --> 00:17:23.590
Honestly, you.

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:29.600
Satone, you used to always hang out
with Yuta back then.

00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:33.820
I required a Hero's abilities
to locate the samsara corridor.

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:37.230
I never would have thought
I would find his base here.

00:17:37.230 --> 00:17:40.150
Shichimiya, I forget.
You didn't know where I lived?

00:17:40.270 --> 00:17:42.250
I knew that even though we were allies, you could

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:44.040
never trust me with that information.

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:46.540
I made several attempts to shadow you.

00:17:47.030 --> 00:17:49.000
Oh, yeah. I remember that.

00:17:49.260 --> 00:17:52.660
You would always warn me
when we left for school in the morning.

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:56.010
You told me to be extra cautious
because we might be followed.

00:17:57.430 --> 00:18:00.010
So, why is Wicked Lord Shingan living here?

00:18:01.610 --> 00:18:03.470
I feel no need to disclose that to my foe.

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:04.850
Hey.

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:07.720
Rikka originally lived in the apartment above us.

00:18:07.720 --> 00:18:10.590
But she found herself homeless by mistake.

00:18:10.590 --> 00:18:13.820
What? So you are a wanderer
without a base in the mundane world?

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:14.740
That's amazing!

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:18.520
N-no, all dark beings are this way.

00:18:18.520 --> 00:18:22.480
After all, I frequently spend time of
non-existence in this world.

00:18:22.480 --> 00:18:26.820
I only took up residence here
due to my contract with Yuta.

00:18:26.820 --> 00:18:28.210
It is merely transitory.

00:18:28.480 --> 00:18:30.700
You're one haughty freeloader.

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:31.990
Contract?

00:18:31.990 --> 00:18:33.710
A contract through Wicked Lord Shingan.

00:18:34.160 --> 00:18:36.660
We have been joined for many moons.

00:18:36.660 --> 00:18:37.830
Really?

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:39.800
Well, it's not really a contract...

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:41.510
These two are going out.

00:18:41.750 --> 00:18:42.130
What?

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:42.970
Kuzuha!

00:18:42.970 --> 00:18:44.820
It... It is merely a contract.

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:48.190
It... It is not as commonplace as
merely "going out."

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:50.650
Yeah. And besides, Kuzuha is here!

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:52.060
Way to go, Hero.

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:52.730
That's too close!

00:18:53.060 --> 00:18:55.350
You found a travelling partner!

00:18:55.350 --> 00:18:57.810
And she's the all-powerful Wicked Lord Shingan!

00:18:57.810 --> 00:19:00.140
I got it. I get it, so back off.

00:19:00.350 --> 00:19:01.440
Wicked Lord Shingan!

00:19:01.440 --> 00:19:02.370
W-what?

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:05.740
What is your goal with Hero?
What is your objective?

00:19:06.190 --> 00:19:09.890
My original goal was to discover
the invisible boundary line.

00:19:09.890 --> 00:19:12.910
We have already achieved that objective
with our combined strength.

00:19:12.910 --> 00:19:15.050
Therefore, my current objective is to awaken

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:17.010
the Dark Flame Dragon sleeping within him.

00:19:17.350 --> 00:19:18.660
Dark Flame Dragon?

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:21.080
I don't recall needing any such thing.

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:24.410
You do. Your spirit-soul demands it.

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:25.640
Hey.

00:19:26.130 --> 00:19:28.860
The Dark Flame Dragon? I see.

00:19:30.800 --> 00:19:33.390
I'm rooting for you, Wicked Lord Shingan.

00:19:38.180 --> 00:19:40.310
Hero, I should head home.

00:19:40.310 --> 00:19:41.560
What? Already?

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:45.410
Yeah. Sophia needs to prepare herself
for battle with the angel.

00:19:45.770 --> 00:19:47.050
What the heck?

00:19:48.110 --> 00:19:49.040
Hero?

00:19:49.360 --> 00:19:50.250
Huh?

00:20:02.290 --> 00:20:04.210
H-hey, Shichimiya!

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:07.100
Hey, wait a second!

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:10.290
That was delicious, thank you.

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:12.800
Tell Kuzuha I said so.

00:20:12.800 --> 00:20:13.810
Listen.

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:17.520
You're in high school now,
so stop being so clingy!

00:20:17.850 --> 00:20:20.820
How come? We always used to touch noses.

00:20:21.100 --> 00:20:23.690
Well, it's banned! Later.

00:20:27.400 --> 00:20:28.570
I forgot.

00:20:28.570 --> 00:20:29.570
Huh?

00:20:29.570 --> 00:20:32.490
I never did say goodbye to you
when I left, did I?

00:20:33.280 --> 00:20:33.960
Yeah.

00:20:34.410 --> 00:20:36.060
I never did say anything to you...

00:20:36.680 --> 00:20:39.340
...when I transferred schools. I just left.

00:20:41.220 --> 00:20:43.560
That's because that would be goodbye.

00:20:43.910 --> 00:20:48.560
Once you say your farewells,
that becomes goodbye.

00:20:49.130 --> 00:20:50.150
Is that how it works?

00:20:50.410 --> 00:20:53.590
As long as you lived somewhere in the world...

00:20:53.590 --> 00:20:55.270
...it was never goodbye.

00:20:56.160 --> 00:20:59.220
It is never goodbye until you say farewell.

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:03.890
That is the logic of the world,
and one of the natural laws.

00:21:06.560 --> 00:21:07.590
You never change.

00:21:09.360 --> 00:21:11.790
I will remain unchanged for all eternity!

00:21:13.360 --> 00:21:16.670
And that is how I was reunited
with Satone Shichimiya.

00:21:20.280 --> 00:21:22.370
She always had that habit.

00:21:22.370 --> 00:21:25.130
It's like a greeting to her.

00:21:25.460 --> 00:21:26.330
The nose?

00:21:26.330 --> 00:21:27.220
Yes, the nose.

00:21:27.450 --> 00:21:28.220
The nose...

00:21:29.920 --> 00:21:32.890
All right, I'll enter into a contract with you.

00:21:34.670 --> 00:21:37.460
I will never go near any girl but you.

00:21:38.430 --> 00:21:39.350
Really?

00:21:39.350 --> 00:21:40.230
Yeah.

00:21:44.100 --> 00:21:49.730
And so, safe in my anxious certainty
that new trouble had yet to come...

00:21:50.650 --> 00:21:54.500
I was filled with careless joy...

00:21:56.020 --> 00:21:58.230
...that I was one step closer to Rikka.

00:22:02.490 --> 00:22:05.970
To Be Continued
